  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Line a large oven tray with baking paper. Thinly slice the tomato. Thinly slice the capsicum into rings. Thinly slice the tofu.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2307838/photos/large/prep_ingredients-06735cf0cc4353235f68adbf3eb5887a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make smoky mayo: Meanwhile, put the vegan mayonnaise, ½ tsp barbecue seasoning and 1 tsp water in a bowl, season with salt and pepper and stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2307839/photos/large/warm_tofu-0c42e013cd6b56e3ee3611e84855f926.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Assemble pizzas: Put 2 pita on the lined tray. Spread with 2 tbs barbecue sauce (see Make it yours), then top with the tomato, capsicum and tofu. Scatter over the remaining barbecue seasoning, drizzle with 2 tsp olive oil and season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2307840/photos/large/assemble_pizzas-fafa7338c270c06de17917a2c1807bd1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake pizzas: Bake the pizzas for 8-10 mins until golden and crisp.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2307841/photos/large/bake_pizzas-e3805b8623b83191b778f945e52e56c8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Drizzle the pizzas with the smoky mayo. Cut into wedges and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2307842/photos/large/serve_up-bbb8f133b68e03878aa5d77881f79f39.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: If you don’t have barbecue sauce, simply sub in tomato sauce instead.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2307843/photos/large/make_it_yours-5726fa14df75d36515ca0fa68319204a.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
